{"id":"retraced-path","name":"Retraced Path","type":"Trace Rifle","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b1448f418424f98b37fd5ad5504c3a09.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/548958835.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Battery","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Enhanced Battery","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0ee59b61e99c52c85c2ea18ab705f700.png","desc":"Strong battery life.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Ionized Battery","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a278b79aba1d341d2a070c0e48d9129a.png","desc":"Large heavy battery.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed"},{"name":"Particle Repeater","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8a273117023794757631a34803314351.png","desc":"Improves stability. \n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Projection Fuse","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa6fcec699a88e768782068d5e509e1.png","desc":"Distance optimizations.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Light Battery","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/006ff9fe30b0ef0309b499f364803b6b.png","desc":"Lightweight, agile battery.\n  •  Increases handling speed\n  •  Increases reload speed"},{"name":"Tactical Battery","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ae0d075c978d54c9fcda3cad72e58f62.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple small improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Genesis","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/087a911353a3586f5346a1cf88d8de05.png","desc":"Breaking a combatant's shield with this weapon fills its magazine from reserves. Energy weapons regenerate ammo on hit when matching the damage type to the combatant's shield."},{"name":"Perpetual Motion","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8b9a4582016210723532907414759e69.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus stability, handling, and reload speed while the wielder is in motion."},{"name":"Shoot to Loot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e8c6e23afe3c4215f0dc0c2941500c28.png","desc":"Shooting an Orb of Power picks it up. Shooting an ammo brick picks it up and automatically reloads all of your equipped weapons from reserves."},{"name":"Subsistence","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa8f4295a71bf47df7ffd8599f7af4d.png","desc":"Defeating targets partially reloads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Killing Wind","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/db2aa71ff6d808929bb0e668dcf0822e.png","desc":"Final blows grant increased mobility, weapon range, and handling for a short duration."},{"name":"Feeding Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/89d7e65f5ebe8d291ea96f128765921d.png","desc":"Each rapid kill with this weapon progressively increases reload speed for a short time."},{"name":"Well-Rounded","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/29d63faf15876cf3a9a382aa857b608b.png","desc":"Throwing a grenade or hitting a target with a charged melee grants a stacking bonus to weapon stability, handling, and range.\n\nUsing a Super grants maximum stacks."},{"name":"Adaptive Munitions","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3b952f8ba0c9afce1a0cc081d23ece03.png","desc":"This weapon adapts its damage output and effectiveness against energy shields that don't match the weapon's damage type."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Disruption Break","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/45b57ce27fa0213218c7cb8f2253c517.png","desc":"Breaking an enemy's shield with this weapon makes them more vulnerable to Kinetic damage for a brief period."},{"name":"Harmony","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a3c1c5e1cb05adef7cf6af6602a0da0.png","desc":"Final blows with other weapons improve this weapon's damage and performance for a short duration."},{"name":"One for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b1bce269c3cd21393131b4f5cffae692.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases damage for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Golden Tricorn","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8ad63f37f2513f56892e0ed20621f5dc.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant bonus damage. While this buff is active, grenade or melee kills of the same damage type greatly increase its damage and duration."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e06b65d6f827b3b6d5f70.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate grenade energy. Activating your grenade ability reloads this weapon from reserves."},{"name":"Focused Fury","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/15fb47018719c99ae37d10f794bc957e.png","desc":"Dealing a portion of the magazine as precision damage grants this weapon bonus damage. The shot count is reset whenever the weapon is reloaded or stowed."},{"name":"Incandescent","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/22ed4a2cd5a0eb129a14ce77db49373f.png","desc":"Defeating a target spreads scorch to those nearby.\nMore powerful combatants and opposing Guardians cause scorch in a larger radius."},{"name":"Golden Tricorn Enhanced","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8ad63f37f2513f56892e0ed20621f5dc.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant bonus damage for an improved duration. While this buff is active, grenade or melee final blows of the same damage type greatly increase its damage for an improved duration."}]}],"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[4,16,20,28],[8,16,20,27],[8,16,20,28],[2,15,20,27],[2,15,20,28],[2,16,20,27],[2,16,20,28],[4,15,20,27],[4,15,20,28],[4,15,20,29],[4,16,20,27],[6,14,18,26],[8,15,20,27],[8,15,20,28]